      "text": "The sheer contrast of a sprawling concrete city completely encircled by the overwhelming expanse of the Amazon basin is mind-blowing. You can practically feel that heavy, suffocating equatorial humidity radiating off the muddy Rio Negro waters. It really shows how nature still dictates terms out there despite human development.",
